        grovenFriction: `The Groven are the Fexric's living shame. The Fexric view them as rogue alchemical property that stole their research and escaped to the surface, refusing to acknowledge them as a sovereign people. In return, the Groven block Fexric trade caravans with extortionate tolls on the Ancestor-Spans. Despite the mutual hatred, they are forced to negotiate: Fexric require the spans to transport coal and machinery across the chasms, while the Groven require Fexric cold-iron anchors and geothermal brackets to keep their calcifying bridges from collapsing under the blizzards.`
