    diasporaVariation: `The Fexrick are the most widely diasporic non-human race because they built, and maintain, the geothermal infrastructure connecting every region. Kethrin guild-halls exist in every capital (Merrowport, Greymark, Atropolis, the Frozen Archive, Harath-Vault, Synod Hold), each staffed by Kethrin who have lived local for generations and speak the local tongue with a Fexric accent. These diaspora Kethrin are culturally flexible in a way the Frostmaw-pure Kethrin distrust. The Drall clan-nomads roam between all regions on maintenance-circuits and are functionally a trans-national people, a Drall speaks seven regional dialects and claims no capital.`,
